<% layout("listings/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<article class="legal-page">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: 18 November 2026</p>

  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    Wanderlust Private Limited ("Wanderlust", "we", "us") operates the Wanderlust accommodation listing website.
    This policy explains what information we handle when you browse or use the site, and how we handle it.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Listing details</strong> you submit: title, description, nightly price, location, country and an optional image link.</li>
    <li><strong>Reviews</strong> you submit: a rating from 1 to 5 and a comment.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical information</strong> that your browser sends with each request, such as your IP address and the pages you visit, which web servers process to deliver the site.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The website does not currently require you to create an account or sign in.</p>

  <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To publish listings and reviews on the website.</li>
    <li>To operate, maintain and improve the website.</li>
    <li>To keep the website secure and prevent misuse.</li>
    <li>To respond to questions or requests you send us.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Public content</h2>
  <p>
    Listings and reviews are visible to anyone who visits the website. Please do not include personal
    information in a listing or review that you do not want to make public, such as a home address or contact details.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The website does not set cookies to track you or to manage accounts. Third-party services that the site loads
    (listed in section 6) may set their own cookies or log requests under their own policies.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Third-party services</h2>
  <p>The website loads the following external resources, each governed by its provider's privacy policy:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Bootstrap and Font Awesome, delivered through jsDelivr and cdnjs.</li>
    <li>Plus Jakarta Sans font, delivered through Google Fonts.</li>
    <li>Listing photos that hosts link to, which are often served by Unsplash or other image hosts.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Data storage and security</h2>
  <p>
    Listing and review data is stored in our database. We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to
    protect it, but no method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Your choices and requests</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us to correct or remove a listing or review that relates to you. Contact us using the details below
    and we will respond within a reasonable time.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>Wanderlust is not intended for children under 18. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so we can remove it.</p>

  <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was last changed.</p>

  <h2>11. Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    For privacy questions, write to us at
    <a href="mailto:privacy@wanderlust.example">privacy@wanderlust.example</a>.
  </p>
</article>
